ictor\\n- Dynamic sliders for monthly marketing budget (₹30,000 to ₹20,00,000+) and industry selector (D2C E-commerce, B2B SaaS, Real Estate, EdTech, Professional Services).\\n- Real-time instant forecast of:\\n  - High-Intent Visitors\\n  - Qualified Conversions / Leads\\n  - Expected ROAS Multiplier (e.g. 4.8x - 6.2x)\\n  - Projected Gross Revenue Lift\\n- 1-click **\\\"Claim This Growth Plan\\\"** button that pre-populates the consultation audit modal.\\n\\n#### ⚡ Free 360° Digital Growth Audit & Strategy Modal\\n- 3-step interactive diagnostic wizard:\\n  1. **Growth Bottlenecks Selector** (Low ROAS, High CAC, Low Website Conversion, Stagnant SEO).\\n  2. **Brand & Website Details** with budget selector.\\n  3. **Instant Delivery & Contact Capture** submitting directly to backend `/api/leads`.\\n- Celebration screen with fast-track direct WhatsApp consultation trigger.\\n\\n#### 💬 Floating WhatsApp Quick-Action Speed Dial\\n- Sticky floating widge\n<truncated 2038 bytes>","Description":"\"Create walkthrough document for the digital marketing agency redesign\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\ashis\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\b658bbd2-2aad-47d2-8dee-60fbb78009cc\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Creating walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Create walkthrough documentation\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
